WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.120
Amazon's Intellectual Property, IP Accelerator, connects you with a vetted network of legal professionals

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.749
who specialize in trademark registration.

00:00:11.749 --> 00:00:16.480
These providers are listed in Amazon's Service Provider Network

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.800
and can guide you through every step of your brand's trademark registration.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.520
The network

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.840
includes law firms across multiple global regions.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.160
Securing a trademark legally registers your brand

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.120
name or logo with a designated government office.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:34.080
It establishes you as the verified owner and

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:39.600
provides legal rights and protection for your brand name and logo as intellectual property.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:45.520
Having a trademark is one of the basic requirements for enrolling in Amazon brand registry,

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:49.120
which offers several benefits for selling in the Amazon store.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.280
You can start your Amazon brand

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:57.200
registry enrollment using your pending trademark application number even before the trademark is

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.096
fully approved.

00:00:58.096 --> 00:01:03.920
This gives you faster access to brand registry benefits and brand protection tools.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:10.800
To access IP Accelerator providers, search for Explore Services in Seller Central.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.240
Adjust the drop-down menus to your business location.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.000
Where do you want to sell?

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:22.400
Select IP Accelerator as your service type and click Search to refresh your results.

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:28.640
Use the filters on the left side to narrow your provider's options based on your specific needs.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:33.440
Review available providers, their services, expertise and client reviews.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.040
When you identify

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:40.909
a suitable provider, click the Contact Provider button to submit your service request.

00:01:40.909 --> 00:01:41.360
Providers

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:47.680
typically respond within two business days with initial information and next steps for your trademark

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:48.733
application process.

00:01:48.733 --> 00:01:54.000
Beyond trademark filing, some providers also provide assistance with the

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.880
patent and copyright application, mediation for IP disputes, holistic brand protection strategies,

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:07.440
and trademark searches for pending applications or registrations similar to your brand name.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.507
Ready to protect your brand?

00:02:09.507 --> 00:02:12.400
Start your trademark journey with IP Accelerator

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:20.000
and gain access to brand registry benefits sooner.
